<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
    body { font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; }
    h1 { color: #2F5496; border-bottom: 2px solid #2F5496; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; }
    h2 { color: #1F3763; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #BDD7EE; padding-bottom: 5px; }
    table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-bottom: 20px; table-layout: fixed; word-wrap: break-word; }
    th, td { border: 1px solid #8497B0; padding: 8px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
    th { background-color: #DDEBF7; font-weight: bold; color: #1F3763; }
    .sr-no { width: 80px; }
    .data-flow { background-color: #FFF2CC; font-weight: bold; width: 100px; text-align: center; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>PC - II Data Dictionary</h1>

<h2>Section 1 — Project Overview & Basic Information</h2>
<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th class="sr-no">Sr. No.</th>
            <th>Information Required</th>
            <th>Input Component</th>
            <th>Expected Data / Business Rules</th>
            <th>Example</th>
            <th>Cross Reference</th>
            <th class="data-flow">Data Flow</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td>PC-II-1.1</td><td>Project Title</td><td>Text Input</td><td>Full formal name of the project</td><td>Punjab Solar Energy Optimization Project</td><td>PC-N-1.1</td><td class="data-flow">DF-3</td></tr>
        <tr><td>PC-II-1.2</td><td>Project ID</td><td>SelectField</td><td>Select Unique ProjectID</td><td>PRJ-2024-0010</td><td>PC-N-1.2</td><td class="data-flow">DF-3</td></tr>
        <tr><td>PC-II-1.4</td><td>Project Start Year</td><td>SelectField</td><td>Financial year</td><td>2024-2025</td><td>PC-N-10.1</td><td class="data-flow">DF-3</td></tr>
        <tr><td>PC-II-1.23</td><td>Local Cost (PKR)</td><td>Auto-calculated</td><td>Calculated from local cost fields</td><td>readonly</td><td>Manual Entry</td><td class="data-flow">DF-3</td></tr>
        <tr><td>PC-II-1.27</td><td>Total Cost (PKR)</td><td>Auto-calculated</td><td>Calculated from all cost fields</td><td>5000</td><td>Manual Entry</td><td class="data-flow">DF-3</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2>Section 2 — Location & Responsibilities</h2>
<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th class="sr-no">Sr. No.</th>
            <th>Information Required</th>
            <th>Input Component</th>
            <th>Expected Data / Business Rules</th>
            <th>Example</th>
            <th>Cross Reference</th>
            <th class="data-flow">Data Flow</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td>PC-II-2.1</td><td>Division</td><td>SelectField</td><td>All divisions of Punjab</td><td>Lahore</td><td>PC-N-9.1</td><td class="data-flow">DF-3</td></tr>
        <tr><td>PC-II-2.2</td><td>District</td><td>SelectField</td><td>Dependent on selected Division</td><td>Kasur</td><td>PC-N-9.2</td><td class="data-flow">DF-3</td></tr>
        <tr><td>PC-II-2.10</td><td>Executing Agency</td><td>SelectField</td><td>Agency performing the work</td><td>C&W Department</td><td>Manual Entry</td><td class="data-flow">DF-3</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h2>Section 6 — Cost Estimation</h2>
<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th class="sr-no">Sr. No.</th>
            <th>Information Required</th>
            <th>Input Component</th>
            <th>Expected Data / Business Rules</th>
            <th>Example</th>
            <th>Cross Reference</th>
            <th class="data-flow">Data Flow</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td>PC-II-6.10</td><td>Search Object Code</td><td>Auto-suggest SelectField</td><td>Search and add specific object codes</td><td>A01101</td><td>Manual Entry</td><td class="data-flow">DF-3</td></tr>
        <tr><td>PC-II-6.11</td><td>Plan Local/Foreign Cost</td><td>InputField grids</td><td>Year-by-year cost array</td><td>2024-2025</td><td>Manual Entry</td><td class="data-flow">DF-3</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<p><i>Note: Full dictionary details available in the source Markdown files.</i></p>
</body>
</html>
